<title>MEXICO: BANCO DE MEXICO TO AUCTION 3.6 BLN PESOS OF CETES.</title>
<headline>BANCO DE MEXICO TO AUCTION 3.6 BLN PESOS OF CETES.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico on Friday said it would auction 3.6 billion pesos worth of Cetes at its primary auction next Tuesday.</p>
<p>The central bank will also auction 1.0 billion pesos of Bondes.</p>
<p>CETES</p>
<p>    Terms	  Amount	     Fixed rates:</p>
<p>     28 days	 800 million pesos  18.09 pct</p>
<p>     91 days     1.000 bln pesos  18.29 pct</p>
<p>    182 days     1.000 bln pesos  18.49 pct</p>
<p>    350 days	 800 million pesos  17.08 pct</p>
<p>BONDES</p>
<p>    364 days	 500 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>    728 days	 500 million pesos  100.0 pct</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-7902))</p>
</text>
